<Base title="About — Shyam Prasad Rao">
  <article class="post">
    <p class="lede">Hi — I'm Shyam.</p>
    <p>I lead commercial PC portfolio strategy at HP's Personal Systems division: where the
      product line goes, how we position for the AI-PC shift, and the silicon and ODM
      partnerships behind it. Before the strategy work I spent time closer to the metal,
      and I've never quite left it.</p>
    <p>Outside work I study quantum information — mostly error correction — and build small
      tools when a question won't leave me alone. This site is where the technical curiosity
      and the commercial day job meet: essays, research notes, and whatever I'm reading.</p>
    <p>Reach me at <a href="mailto:shyamprasadrao@gmail.com">shyamprasadrao@gmail.com</a>,
      or on <a href="https://github.com/shyam-lab" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.</p>
